package: @astryxdesign/lab

# TransferListSelector

Use TransferListSelector with immediate behavior by default: each list edit commits and no footer renders. Use staged behavior to review a draft and commit from Apply. Use TransferList directly only inside a custom ComplexSelector surface with saved views, presets, or custom actions.

**Import:** `import {TransferListSelector} from '@astryxdesign/lab';`

## Anatomy

| Element | Required | Description |
|---------|----------|-------------|
| Field label and description | Yes | Names and explains the selector outside the popover so placement does not change with supporting text. |
| Selector trigger | Yes | Summarizes the committed value and opens the transfer-list popover. |
| Search | No | Filters the selected and available lists without changing their values and uses a uniform 12px inset. |
| Selected and available sections | Yes | Places two unframed semantic lists beside one divider. Narrow containers stack the sections, use the body background behind each column header, expand both sections to their rows, and delegate overflow to one scrollable containing surface. |
| Row actions | Yes | Uses a direction-neutral X to remove and plus to add. Selected rows end with a reorder handle when reordering is enabled; a row that keeps its place has none, and transfer constraints disable the remove action. |
| Reorder hint | No | While a selected row is in reorder mode: the hint below its handle, whose Move up, Move down and Done are buttons. |
| Bulk actions | No | Optional Clear and Add all text actions that honor transfer-disabled options. |
| Apply and Cancel footer | No | Rendered only for staged behavior. Apply commits a changed draft; Cancel closes without changing the committed value. |
| Live announcements | Yes | Reports add, remove, bulk, and reorder results without relying on visual position alone. |

## Best Practices

- **Do:** Default to immediate behavior; each edit calls onChange and dismiss keeps committed changes.
- **Do:** Use commitBehavior="staged" for review or transactional persistence; Apply commits and Cancel/Escape/light dismiss discard.
- **Do:** Use direct TransferList plus ComplexSelector only for custom saved views, presets, headers, or actions; reset draft from applied value on open.
- **Do:** Set transfer and reorder constraints independently and explain a locked transfer with disabledMessage.
- **Do:** Keep rows single-line; descriptions remain searchable metadata.
- **Don't:** Use commitBehavior for presentation/container choice; both values use the selector popover.
- **Don't:** Use for a few simple choices; prefer CheckboxInput.

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `label` | `string` | - | External field label and accessible name. **(required)** |
| `options` | `readonly TransferListOption<T>[]` | - | Full pool: value, label, description?, group?, isTransferDisabled?, disabledMessage?. **(required)** |
| `value` | `readonly T[]` | - | Committed selected values in display order. **(required)** |
| `onChange` | `(nextValue: readonly T[]) => void` | - | Called per edit in immediate behavior or from changed Apply in staged behavior. **(required)** |
| `commitBehavior` | `TransferListSelectorCommitBehavior` | `'immediate'` | TransferListSelectorCommitBehavior: immediate (default, no footer) or staged (draft plus Apply/Cancel). |
| `triggerLabel` | `ReactNode` | ``${value.length} selected`` | Closed-trigger content; defaults to selected count. |
| `description` | `string` | - | Supporting field guidance outside the popover. |
| `isLabelHidden` | `boolean` | `false` | Hide field label visually, preserving its name. |
| `selectedLabel` | `string` | `'Selected'` | Selected-list heading and name. |
| `availableLabel` | `string` | `'Available'` | Available-list heading and name. |
| `hasSearch` | `boolean` | `false` | Shared list filter; default false. |
| `searchLabel` | `string` | `'Search ' followed by label` | Accessible search label. |
| `searchPlaceholder` | `string` | `'Search...'` | Search placeholder. |
| `reorderable` | `Reorderable<T>` | - | createReorderable object for a trailing reorder handle (touch hold, mouse drag, keys); its isReorderable says which values move; staged moves change the draft; paused while searching. |
| `hasSelectAll` | `boolean` | `false` | Add all transfer-enabled available options. |
| `hasClear` | `boolean` | `false` | Remove all transfer-enabled selected options. |
| `renderOption` | `(option: TransferListOption<T>) => ReactNode` | - | Custom row content. |
| `selectedEmptyText` | `string` | `'No selected options'` | Selected-list empty message. |
| `availableEmptyText` | `string` | `'No available options'` | Available-list empty message. |
| `noResultsText` | `string` | `'No results'` | No search matches message. |
| `applyLabel` | `string` | `'Apply'` | Staged Apply label; default Apply. |
| `cancelLabel` | `string` | `'Cancel'` | Staged Cancel label; default Cancel. |
| `size` | `'sm' \| 'md' \| 'lg'` | `'md'` | Field and trigger size. |
| `width` | `SizeValue` | `'min(41rem, calc(100vw - 32px))'` | External field width; its default matches the responsive 41rem popup. |
| `placement` | `'above' \| 'below' \| 'start' \| 'end'` | `'below'` | Popover placement relative to trigger. |
| `isOptional` | `boolean` | - | Mark field optional. |
| `isRequired` | `boolean` | - | Mark field required. |
| `isDisabled` | `boolean` | - | Disable selector trigger and transfer interaction. |
| `isLoading` | `boolean` | - | Show loading state and disable transfer interaction. |
| `status` | `{type: 'warning' \| 'error' \| 'success', message?: string}` | - | Field validation status. |
| `statusVariant` | `'attached' \| 'detached' \| 'tooltip'` | - | Status placement treatment. |
| `labelTooltip` | `string` | - | Field-label tooltip. |
| `changeAction` | `(value: readonly T[]) => void \| Promise<void>` | - | Async action after each immediate commit or changed staged Apply. |
| `controlXstyle` | `StyleXStyles` | - | StyleX styles for the external selector's bordered control box. |
| `controlClassName` | `string` | - | Class name applied to the external selector's control box. |
| `controlStyle` | `CSSProperties` | - | Inline styles applied to the external selector's control box. |
| `data-testid` | `string` | - | Selector trigger test ID. |

## Components

### TransferList

Lower-level controlled content for custom ComplexSelector surfaces; changes its controlled value immediately.

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `label` | `string` | - | Accessible control label. **(required)** |
| `isLabelHidden` | `boolean` | `false` | Hide control label visually, preserving its name. |
| `description` | `string` | - | Supporting control guidance. |
| `options` | `readonly TransferListOption<T>[]` | - | Full pool with metadata, groups, and transfer constraints. **(required)** |
| `value` | `readonly T[]` | - | Selected values in display order. **(required)** |
| `onChange` | `(nextValue: readonly T[]) => void` | - | Called after each add/remove/bulk change; moves go to onReorder. **(required)** |
| `selectedLabel` | `string` | `'Selected'` | Selected-list heading and name. |
| `availableLabel` | `string` | `'Available'` | Available-list heading and name. |
| `hasSearch` | `boolean` | `false` | Shared list filter; default false. |
| `isDisabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Disable every control; rows and search stay focusable; default false. |
| `searchLabel` | `string` | - | Accessible search label. |
| `searchPlaceholder` | `string` | `'Search...'` | Search placeholder. |
| `reorderable` | `Reorderable<T>` | - | createReorderable object (its isReorderable says which values move; its onReorder gets {key, to} in value terms); paused while searching. |
| `hasSelectAll` | `boolean` | `false` | Add all transfer-enabled options. |
| `hasClear` | `boolean` | `false` | Remove all transfer-enabled selected options. |
| `renderOption` | `(option: TransferListOption<T>) => ReactNode` | - | Custom row content. |
| `selectedEmptyText` | `string` | `'No selected options'` | Selected-list empty message. |
| `availableEmptyText` | `string` | `'No available options'` | Available-list empty message. |
| `noResultsText` | `string` | `'No results'` | No search matches message. |
| `xstyle` | `StyleXStyles` | - | TransferList-root StyleX override. |

## Examples

### Default immediate selector

```tsx
const [fields, setFields] = useState(['name', 'status']);

<TransferListSelector
  label="Visible fields"
  description="Choose which fields appear. Changes take effect immediately."
  triggerLabel={fields.length + ' visible fields'}
  options={[
    {value: 'name', label: 'Name'},
    {value: 'status', label: 'Status'},
    {value: 'owner', label: 'Owner'},
  ]}
  value={fields}
  onChange={setFields}
  selectedLabel="Visible fields"
  availableLabel="Available fields"
  hasSelectAll
  hasClear
/>
```

### Staged commit

```tsx
const [fields, setFields] = useState(['name', 'status']);

<TransferListSelector
  label="Visible fields"
  description="Review the complete selection before applying it."
  options={fieldOptions}
  value={fields}
  onChange={setFields}
  commitBehavior="staged"
  selectedLabel="Visible fields"
  availableLabel="Available fields"
  hasSelectAll
  hasClear
/>
```

### Independent transfer and reorder constraints

```tsx
const reorderable = useMemo(
  () =>
    createReorderable<string>({
      onReorder: ({key, to}) => setFields(fields => moveTo(fields, key, to)),
      // Status keeps its place, but can be removed.
      isReorderable: value => value !== 'status',
    }),
  [],
);

<TransferListSelector
  label="Visible fields"
  options={[
    {
      value: 'name',
      label: 'Name',
      isTransferDisabled: true,
      disabledMessage: 'Name must remain visible.',
    },
    {value: 'status', label: 'Status'},
    {value: 'owner', label: 'Owner'},
  ]}
  reorderable={reorderable}
  value={fields}
  onChange={setFields}
/>
```

### Migrating from isReorderable to reorderable

```tsx
// BEFORE: isReorderable turned reordering on, and an option opted out.
<TransferList
  options={[{value: 'name', label: 'Name', isReorderDisabled: true}, ...rest]}
  isReorderable
  value={fields}
  onChange={setFields}
/>;

// AFTER: reordering is opt-in through the object createReorderable makes.
const reorderable = useMemo(
  () =>
    createReorderable<string>({
      onReorder: ({key, to}) => setFields(fields => moveTo(fields, key, to)),
      isReorderable: value => value !== 'name',
    }),
  [],
);

<TransferList
  options={[{value: 'name', label: 'Name'}, ...rest]}
  reorderable={reorderable}
  value={fields}
  onChange={setFields}
/>;
```

### Saved views in a custom ComplexSelector

```tsx
const savedViews = {
  standard: ['name', 'status', 'owner'],
  ownership: ['name', 'owner', 'team'],
};
const [applied, setApplied] = useState(savedViews.standard);
const [draft, setDraft] = useState(applied);
const activeSavedView =
  Object.entries(savedViews).find(
    ([, columns]) =>
      columns.length === draft.length &&
      columns.every((column, index) => column === draft[index]),
  )?.[0] ?? 'custom';

function ResetDraftOnOpen({isOpen, value, onReset}) {
  const wasOpenRef = useRef(false);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (isOpen && !wasOpenRef.current) {
      onReset([...value]);
    }
    wasOpenRef.current = isOpen;
  }, [isOpen, onReset, value]);

  return null;
}

<ComplexSelector
  label="View options"
  isLabelHidden
  triggerLabel="View options"
  value={applied}
  onChange={setApplied}>
  {(_appliedValue, commit, close, state) => (
    <>
      <ResetDraftOnOpen
        isOpen={state.isOpen}
        value={applied}
        onReset={setDraft}
      />
      <Selector
        label="Saved view"
        options={savedViewOptions}
        value={activeSavedView}
        onChange={nextSavedView => {
          setDraft(savedViews[nextSavedView]);
        }}
      />
      <TransferList
        label="Visible fields"
        isLabelHidden
        options={fieldOptions}
        value={draft}
        onChange={setDraft}
        selectedLabel="Visible fields"
        availableLabel="Available fields"
        hasSelectAll
        hasClear
      />
      <Button label="Cancel" variant="ghost" onClick={close} />
      <Button
        label="Apply"
        variant="primary"
        onClick={() => {
          commit(draft);
          close();
        }}
      />
    </>
  )}
</ComplexSelector>
```

## Theming

| Component class | Preferred data attributes | Props | States |
|-----------------|---------------------------|-------|--------|
| `astryx-transfer-list` | - | - | - |
| `astryx-transfer-list-collection` | - | - | - |
| `astryx-transfer-list-panel` | `data-side` | side | - |
| `astryx-transfer-list-item` | `data-side`, `data-state`, `data-reorder` | side, state, reorder | - |

Override in defineTheme:
```ts
components: {
  'transfer-list': {
    base: { /* CSS properties */ },
  },
  'transfer-list-collection': {
    base: { /* CSS properties */ },
  },
}
```
